    "description": "YE DIGITAL Corporation provides Internet of Things (IoT) solutions in Japan. The company offers logistics solutions, such as warehouse automation system (WES), automated inter-process transport package, decision support dashboard, and AI solutions for logistics warehouses; transportation solutions, such as smart bus stop and mobility signage cloud; agriculture and livestock solutions, including feed tank balance management solutions, feed ordering operations, rationalization of feed distribution, and tank balance monitoring solutions; Business DX Support solutions, including business brands that evolve corporate value through data, services that connect the value of data to business, business DX center and ERP management efficiency improvement; maintenance and conservation solutions, such as IoT platform, Al fault prediction service, and IoT/M2M communication devices; inspection, monitoring, and optimization (AI) support for generative Al software development; and Al image evaluation services. It also offers education solutions, including on-campus LAN security, school specialist help desk, and timetable creation system; cyberattack countermeasures and multifunctional appliance servers; operational support and services operation and maintenance knowledge-sharing Al services, such as system operation support and SAP operation and maintenance; and social system development solution. The company was formerly known as Yaskawa Information Systems Corporation and changed its name to YE DIGITAL Corporation in March 2019. YE DIGITAL Corporation was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Kitakyushu, Japan."
